 [sq('The bridge ___ built in 2010.',['was','were']),sq('These houses were ___ by volunteers.',['built','build']),eq('A person who works for others without pay is a…','ያለ ክፍያ ለሌሎች የሚሠራ ሰው…',['volunteer','thief','tourist']),eq('Which is a duty of a good citizen?','የመልካም ዜጋ ግዴታ የትኛው ነው?',['obeying the law','breaking rules','wasting water'])],
